<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Bless</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 9), Paladin (guild level 35)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast bless &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast bless</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Calls the gods' good attention to the target. For a while their strength, 
dexterity, brain and divine power are all raised: a point or two at first, up 
to ten points and a little more for a master. It lasts five minutes or more.
</p><p>It works on humanoids and mammals, and always on yourself. It doesn't add 
up: on someone already blessed, or under an unholy blessing, nothing happens. 
You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Curse</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Abilities</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>